  "implementation": [
    "Frozen declaration and unique native journal/state per original test attempt and retry. Private adapter exposes defineFeatures and capabilityDiscovery.",
    "Caught selected native violations fail the original runner attempt during teardown; source location and native details remain in the attempt receipt.",
    "Host exclusions persist even when caught before context creation. Contexts and pending creations remain owned by their original attempt.",
    "Host launch disposition requires original native launch/wait receipts whenever launch was requested. A recorded attempt cannot relaunch its original browser after disconnect.",
    "Unexpected browser disconnect, incomplete native counters, missing journal or missing browser receipt reject the attempt.",
    "Failed preparation retires before successor admission. Original browser group drain and native completion counters precede acceptance.",
    "Native page-error text is not evidence of a capability violation; the native journal supplies that attribution."
  ],
